senses.gloss:
रिफ् cl. 6. P. (Dhātup. xxviii, 23) रिफति (p. -रेफत्, ŚāṅkhBr.; pf. रिरेफ &c. Gr.; ind.p. रेफित्वा, Pāṇ. i, 2, 23, Sch.),
to snarl, AV.;
 (only L.) to speak or boast (कथने or कत्थने);
to blame;
to fight;
to give;
to hurt, kill (cf. √ रिम्फ्) :
Pass. रिफ्यते, to be murmured or spoken in a guttural or burring manner (like the letter र्);
 to have or take the pronunciation of the letter र्, ĀśvŚr. (cf. रेफ).
